<title>UK: Manchester air cargo up 15.8pct in June.</title>
<headline>Manchester air cargo up 15.8pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo including mail at Manchester airport rose by 15.8 percent in June to 8,197 tonnes taking the total for first half 1997 to 43,208 tonnes or up 15.4 percent on the same period last year.</p>
<p>The airport said that during June inbound freight totalled 4,026 tonnes and outbound 4,171 tonnes. In the 12 months to end June inbound traffic at 44,360 tonnes just outweighed outbound cargo of 43,557 tonnes:</p>
<p>		    June'97  Pct	 Jan-Jun   Pct	 Jul-Jun</p>
<p>				 Change	'97     Change    '96-'97</p>
<p>Freight</p>
<p>(Excl Mail)</p>
<p>Scheduled	  4,451   up 15.9    25,697   up 19.8    51,989</p>
<p>Charter	    3,441   up 18.5    15,442   up  7.7    31,595</p>
<p>Total		7,892   up 17.0    41,139   up 14.9    83,584</p>
